cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GAFIME in research or publications, please cite this software.
  If you use a GAFIME-based research method, please also cite the
  corresponding method paper where applicable.
type: software
title: "GAFIME: GPU-Accelerated Feature Interaction Mining Engine"
authors:
  - family-names: Usta
    given-names: Hamza
repository-code: "https://github.com/onlyxItachi/GAFIME"
url: "https://github.com/onlyxItachi/GAFIME"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  GAFIME is a native heterogeneous feature-interaction mining engine for
  tabular and structured machine-learning workflows, with Rust CPU/SIMD,
  CUDA, ROCm/HIP, and Metal execution backends.
keywords:
  - feature interaction mining
  - feature engineering
  - tabular machine learning
  - heterogeneous computing
  - GPU acceleration
